Package: isochronesci
Title: Public CI and Scientific-Validation Harness for the Isochrones Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tyler", "Muffly", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "tyler.muffly@dhha.org")
Description: A deliberately small, public proving ground that exercises the
    production isochrones/accessibility system against synthetic fixtures and
    checks its answers against an independent reference implementation. This is
    a verifier, not a second production implementation: it contains no
    production algorithms, no real patient- or physician-level data, and no
    canonical datasets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    sf,
    yaml,
    jsonlite,
    digest,
    withr,
    mufflyaccess
Remotes:
    mufflyt/mufflyaccess
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
